    "11": {
      "title": "Support & Next Steps",
      "content": "## Slide 11: Support & Next Steps\n\n**Post-Implementation Support:**\n\n* Dedicated account manager for initial 3 months post-launch.\n* 24/7 email and phone support for critical issues.\n* Remote diagnostics and troubleshooting.\n* Quarterly performance reviews and optimization sessions.\n\n\n**Maintenance and Updates:**\n\n* Ongoing system maintenance and security patching.\n* Regular software updates incorporating new AI advancements and feature enhancements.\n* Proactive monitoring for performance and stability.\n* Annual software license renewal with prioritized support.\n\n\n**Training and Knowledge Transfer:**\n\n* Comprehensive training program for key personnel, covering system navigation, data interpretation, and reporting.\n* On-site training sessions (duration: 2 days).\n* Access to online training modules and documentation.\n* Ongoing support for query resolution.\n\n\n**Next Steps and Timeline:**\n\n* **Week 1-2:** Contract signing and project kickoff meeting.\n* **Week 3-8:** System setup, data integration, and customization.\n* **Week 9-12:** User acceptance testing and training sessions.\n* **Week 13:** System go-live and initial post-launch support.\n\n\n**Contact Information:**\n\n* **Project Manager:** [Name], [Title], [Email], [Phone]\n* **Support Team:** [Email], [Phone]\n* **xyz Website:** [Website Address]",
      "versions": [
        {
          "version": 1,
          "content": "## Slide 11: Support & Next Steps\n\n**Post-Implementation Support:**\n\n* Dedicated account manager for initial 3 months post-launch.\n* 24/7 email and phone support for critical issues.\n* Remote diagnostics and troubleshooting.\n* Quarterly performance reviews and optimization sessions.\n\n\n**Maintenance and Updates:**\n\n* Ongoing system maintenance and security patching.\n* Regular software updates incorporating new AI advancements and feature enhancements.\n* Proactive monitoring for performance and stability.\n* Annual software license renewal with prioritized support.\n\n\n**Training and Knowledge Transfer:**\n\n* Comprehensive training program for key personnel, covering system navigation, data interpretation, and reporting.\n* On-site training sessions (duration: 2 days).\n* Access to online training modules and documentation.\n* Ongoing support for query resolution.\n\n\n**Next Steps and Timeline:**\n\n* **Week 1-2:** Contract signing and project kickoff meeting.\n* **Week 3-8:** System setup, data integration, and customization.\n* **Week 9-12:** User acceptance testing and training sessions.\n* **Week 13:** System go-live and initial post-launch support.\n\n\n**Contact Information:**\n\n* **Project Manager:** [Name], [Title], [Email], [Phone]\n* **Support Team:** [Email], [Phone]\n* **xyz Website:** [Website Address]",
